   With an argument, select that draft directly.

   Provide shell tab completion for basenames in tmp/.

   Once a draft has been selected, show the questions
   generated by 'yhwh begin'.

   Let the human answer those questions interactively.

   Keep the interaction simple.

   Use multiple-choice questions where sensible and
