   The human can now inspect the script in run/ manually.

   Or the human can run it directly.

   Or the human can use 'yhwh run'.

   These are intentionally different execution paths.

   C. EXECUTION: DIRECT SCRIPTS AND 'yhwh run'

   Every executable script in run/ should work as an ordinary
