       run/

   The user should be able to select:

       - One task.
       - Several tasks.
       - All tasks.

   and execute the selection.

   Use a pleasant, conventional Unix TUI.

   Keep it simple and keyboard-friendly.

   Support shell tab completion for task names in run/.

   Support multiple explicit task names where practical.

   Resolve task names unambiguously.

   Don't execute files outside run/ through path traversal,
